OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers and
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Breezy especially around
OL,8,Fthe coasts, but feeling cooler and
OL,9,Ffresher compared to recent nights
OL,10,Fthough cloud and breeze keeping
OL,11,Ftemperatures up.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mixture of sunshine and
OL,14,Fshowers on Wednesday, these most
OL,15,Ffrequent in the morning before easing
OL,16,Ffrom the west. Rain then arriving
OL,17,Fovernight. Cooler than Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
