OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fdamp start to Thursday with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain clearing to showers. Further
OL,8,Fwet weather arriving by the afternoon
OL,9,Fon Friday. Dull on Saturday with rain
OL,10,Fand stronger winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
